; Lorenz (1996) on a ring of 40 with its variational equations:
; lorenz96-rk4-fp64 and one tangent vector, stepped beside the state by
; the same program; the tangent is derived (docs/LANGUAGE.md, "The
; variational equations").
system lorenz96
format fp64
round  rne
state  x[40] cyclic
tangent v
param  F = 8
d/dt x[i] = fma(x[i+1] - x[i-2], x[i-1], F - x[i])
step   rk4, h = 1/100
